;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ROBINRBL.MAC -- room blocks.
;
; Ported verbatim from the ZX original, $5B00-$79F8.  Labels keep the original
; addresses: L<hex address>.
;
; L5B00 is the block address table, 84. words, one per block.
;
; Each block starts with a header byte, decoded by the ZX routine at $C0D1:
;   bit 7      natural-mirror flag; XORed with the placing token's own mirror
;              bit and the room's world-map bit 7 to decide mirroring at draw time
;   bit 6      flat-attribute flag; 1 = a single attribute byte fills the whole
;              block instead of one attribute row per cell row
;   bit 5      unused
;   bits 0-4   pixel row count / 8, so pixel rows = (header AND 037) * 8.,
;              each row 4 bytes / 32 pixels wide
;   bits 0-2   reused as the attribute row count, each row 4 bytes wide,
;              appended immediately after the pixel data
;
; Five blocks carry more trailing bytes than that attribute-row count accounts
; for; those surplus bytes are kept verbatim and marked below.
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------

; Block address table, 84. entries
